    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7422" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρρώννῡμι</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέρρωσα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strengthen afresh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.694d
			</span></i>, etc.:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>regain strength,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρρωσθέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.46
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.75c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γονὴν ἀναρρώννυσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecyd.
					33
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσήσας ἀνέρρωσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					57
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.182b
			</span></i>.</div>
